media: qcom: camss: Add SM6115

SM6115 has QCM2290's camera subsystem with a third CSIPHY, CSID and VFE. This adds the binding, the
driver data and the SoC's device tree nodes.

Tested on a Moto G Power (2021), capturing raw frames on all three CSIPHYs through RDI. The phone's
own nodes come in a later series, as they need sensor drivers that aren't upstream yet.
